## 3. Deep Dive: Pages & Routes (`src/app/`)

Every major feature in UniVerse is isolated into its own route segment within the `src/app/` directory.

### 3.1 Core Navigation & Onboarding
- **`/` (`page.tsx`)**: The **Landing/Home Page**. This is an unauthenticated marketing page designed to convert visitors into users. It likely features high-quality hero sections, feature highlights using Framer Motion scroll animations, and calls-to-action (CTAs) directing users to `/signup` or `/auth`.
- **`/dashboard` (`dashboard/page.tsx`)**: The **Command Center**. Once authenticated, users land here. It aggregates data from all other modules—showing an upcoming event, unread messages, a snapshot of the AI tutor's latest tip, and quick links. It relies heavily on Server Components to fetch all this disparate data in parallel before sending the HTML to the client.
- **`/auth` (`auth/page.tsx`)**: The **Login Page**. Handles user authentication flow using Supabase Auth UI or custom forms. 
- **`/signup` (`signup/page.tsx`)**: The **Registration Page**. Specialized onboarding flow where students register, verify their `.edu` email address, and define their initial profile details (major, graduation year, interests).
- **`/request-university` (`request-university/page.tsx`)**: For users whose university isn't supported yet. Submits a form to a database table to gauge interest and plan expansion.

### 3.2 Social & Communication
- **`/feed` (`feed/page.tsx`)**: The **Social Hub**. Features a dual-feed system. Users can toggle between "Campus" (posts specifically from their university) and "Universe" (global posts from all universities on the platform). It supports infinite scrolling, image uploads, and threaded comments.
- **`/messages` (`messages/page.tsx`)**: **Real-time Direct Messaging**. Uses Supabase Realtime (WebSockets) to deliver instant messaging between students. Includes one-on-one chats and group capabilities.
- **`/forums` (`forums/page.tsx`)**: **Course-Specific Discussion**. Anonymous or public threads tied directly to university courses (e.g., "CS101 Fall 2026"). Great for peer support without the pressure of a social feed.

### 3.3 Academics & Productivity
- **`/academic` (`academic/page.tsx`)**: The **AI Tutor & Study Hub**. The crown jewel of the platform's AI capability. Here, students interact with Google Gemini as a specialized tutor. It also acts as a repository for study resources, course management, and study group coordination.

### 3.4 Career & Professional Development
- **`/career` (`career/page.tsx`)**: The **Career Center**. A massive module encompassing a job board, AI resume analysis, mock interviews, and alumni networking. It transforms the student journey into a professional pathway.

### 3.5 Campus Life & Utilities
- **`/events` (`events/page.tsx`)**: **Event Discovery**. A unified calendar for university-sanctioned events, club meetings, and student parties. Includes RSVP functionality and ticketing logic.
- **`/clubs` (`clubs/page.tsx`)**: **Student Organizations**. A directory of all campus clubs. Club admins can manage rosters, post updates, and recruit members.
- **`/marketplace` (`marketplace/page.tsx`)**: **Student Commerce**. A specialized peer-to-peer Craigslist/eBay just for the campus. Buy, sell, or trade textbooks, mini-fridges, and electronics safely with other verified students.
- **`/travel` (`travel/page.tsx`)**: **Ride-sharing**. Students going home for the holidays or heading to an away game can post open seats. Matches drivers with passengers to split gas costs.
- **`/wellness` (`wellness/page.tsx`)**: **Mental Health Tracking**. Mood tracking, journaling, and data visualization. Helps students monitor their stress levels over the semester and provides resources if they need professional help.
- **`/utilities` (`utilities/page.tsx`)**: **Campus Tools**. Integrates real-time bus tracking, interactive campus maps, and local student discount hubs. 
- **`/news` (`news/page.tsx`)**: **Announcements**. Official university news, dean's office announcements, and student journalism.

### 3.6 Platform Operations
- **`/research` (`research/page.tsx`)**: **Academic Collaboration**. A space for professors and grad students to post research opportunities and recruit undergrads.
- **`/updates` (`updates/page.tsx`)**: **Changelog**. Keeps the user base informed about new UniVerse features, bug fixes, and transparent roadmaps. Includes feedback submission.
- **`/settings` (`settings/page.tsx`)**: **User Configuration**. Profile editing, privacy toggles, notification preferences, and visual theme choices.

